{"id":"629023","name":"花朵厚蛋烧","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/629023/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"3个"},{"name":"火腿片","amount":"一片"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"油","amount":"一丢丢(少许)"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"火腿片用切模切成小花。","img":"images/629023/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"火腿花朵朵。","img":"images/629023/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"边角料切成末，准备好鸡蛋和葱。","img":"images/629023/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"蛋白里加入葱花和火腿末。","img":"images/629023/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"蛋黄放入另外一个碗中。","img":"images/629023/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"划散，加少许盐。","img":"images/629023/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"起锅烧热，加一丢丢油。","img":"images/629023/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"到入蛋黄摊平煎熟。","img":"images/629023/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"从一边卷起。","img":"images/629023/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"倒入蛋黄再次摊平煎熟。","img":"images/629023/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"卷起。","img":"images/629023/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"依次倒完全部的蛋黄煎熟。","img":"images/629023/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"卷起。","img":"images/629023/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"倒入蛋白摊平煎熟。","img":"images/629023/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"卷起(重复两次)。","img":"images/629023/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"放入火腿花朵。","img":"images/629023/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"再倒入蛋白摊平煎熟。","img":"images/629023/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"卷起。","img":"images/629023/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"稍微煎一下定型(全程小火)。","img":"images/629023/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"切块食用。","img":"images/629023/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/629023/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/629023/step_22.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}